{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quantum Velocity is a fast-paced, arcade-style 3D racing game set in a futuristic world. Race against up to 8 other players in  multi-player mode or AI opponents in single-player mode and compete for the top spot on the global online leaderboards. The game offers over 25 unique tracks and more than 200 vehicles to unlock.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features currently in the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player races with up to 12 AI opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi-player races with up to 8 other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global leaderboards to compete for the top spots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard and partial controller support for racing (controller recommended). Mouse is used only for some menu interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 unique vehicles to unlock, each with varying stats like Max Speed, Acceleration, Steering, and Braking. Find the one that suits your style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25+ unique tracks to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique music for each track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple local player stats, including credits, unlocked vehicles, total races, and total races won.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galactic Arcade in the Extras with 3 mini-games to win credits in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Early version of the Galactic Music Player, featuring every music track in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports 16:9 resolutions only.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planned Features for Early Access Development:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional tracks and vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expanded controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More in-game settings.</p></li></ul>","achievements